  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mroot><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mroot></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding the equation&nbsp;(i)+(ii), we get</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>24</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
